cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pollinatoR, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "pollinatoR: Uncertainty-Aware Pollinator-Dependence Analytics for Exclusion Experiments"
version: 0.0.0.9000
authors:
  - family-names: Moldovan
    given-names: Max
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9680-8474"
repository-code: "https://github.com/max578/pollinatoR"
url: "https://github.com/max578/pollinatoR"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Tools for estimating the contribution of insect pollinators to crop yield
  from pollinator-exclusion experiments, with model-based treatment effects,
  uncertainty-aware dependence indices, a confounder-robust within-between
  moderation, and a guard against spurious index-versus-yield correlation.
keywords:
  - pollination
  - crop yield
  - mixed models
  - causal inference
  - R
